iness value across Manufacturing, Marketing, Supply Chain, Finance, and Consumer Insights. You will translate business problems into scalable analytical solutions, automate insights, and support enterprise decision-making.\\n\\nYou will work with product owners, data engineers, and stakeholders to develop production-grade analytics and reusable pipelines, including GenAI-enabled applications and\",\"apply_link\":\"https://www.jobleads.com/us/job/ml-genai-data-scientist-driving-pet-care-impact--st-louis--ea06dc436442c673527c9eb495c3e1b16?utm_campaign=google_jobs_apply&utm_source=google_jobs_apply&utm_medium=organic\"},{\"title\":\"HOW TO BECOME A DATA SCIENTIST: A 2026 GUIDE\",\"company\":\"FundiConnectSA\",\"location\":\"Missouri\",\"description\":\"Home Career Guidance How to Become a Data Scientist: A 2026 Guide\\n\\nCareer Guidancecareerspractical Tradesqualifications\\n\\nHow to Become a Data Scientist: A 2026 Guide\\n\\nby FundiConnect Editorial Team | 21 May 2026\\n\\n Last updated 2 August 2026\\n\\nData science is one of the most in-demand careers in South Africa right now. Banks, hospitals, retailers, telecoms and government departments are all building data teams, and the gap between the skills they need and the people who have them is still very real.\\n\\nThat gap is your opportunity.\\n\\nWhether you\\u2019re a matric learner weighing up your options, a university student thinking about specialising or a working professional considering a career switch, this guide will walk you through exactly what it takes to become a data scientist in South Africa in 2026.\\n\\nTable of Contents\\n\\nWhat Does a Data Scientist Do?\\n\\nBefore committing to a career path, it helps to understand what the job actually looks like day to day.\\n\\nIn Practice, You Might Spend Your Time\\n\\nAnalysing customer behaviour data for a retail company to predict which products will sell best next seasonBuilding a machine learning model for a bank to detect fraudulent transactions