  "search_analyst_output": "{\"search_results\":[{\"title\":\"Marketing Specialist - Early Life Strategy\",\"company\":\"Verizon\",\"location\":\"Rolling Meadows, IL\",\"description\":\"When you join Verizon\\n\\nYou want more out of a career. A place to share your ideas freely \\u2014 even if they\\u2019re daring or different. Where the true you can learn, grow, and thrive. At Verizon, we power and empower how people live, work and play by connecting them to what brings them joy. We do what we love \\u2014 driving innovation, creativity, and impact in the world. Our V Team is a community of people who anticipate, lead, and believe that listening is where learning begins. In crisis and in celebration, we come together \\u2014 lifting our communities and building trust in how we show up, everywhere & always. Want in? Join the #VTeamLife.\\n\\nWhat You\\u2019ll Be Doing...\\n\\nAs a Consultant Marketing, Early Life Strategy, you will be responsible for leveraging customer behavioral data and analytics to drive retention strategies. You will analyze detailed customer performance data to uncover strategic opportunities, optimize marketing programming, and measure campaign effectiveness to reduce churn and maximize budget efficiency. This position works closely with internal teams to implement data-driven marketing plans, and map customer journeys. You will develop and monitor test plans to evaluate strategic performance and package complex analytical insights into clear, professional narratives for peers and leadership.\\n\\nResponsibilities Include\\n\\n\\n\\nAnalyzing base customer behavioral data and complex data sets to uncover strategic opportunities, identify primary drivers of churn, and inform retention tac\",\"apply_link\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/marketing-specialist-early-life-strategy-at-verizon-4450510558?utm_campaign=google_jobs_apply&utm_source=google_jobs_apply&utm_medium=organic\"},{\"title\":\"Marketing Inter\",\"company\":\"Gorgeous Growth Group\",\"location\":\"Anywhere\",\"description\":\"Gorgeous Growth LLC is a boutique consulting agency and professional network rooted in ethical and sustainable business practices. Our \\u2018Gorgie Method\\u2019 guides creators, entrepreneurs, and go-getters through three stages: Set, Scale, Match, supported by our three branches: Knowledge, Network, and Toolkits, creating an ecosystem of growth.\\u00a0\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nWe are Chicago-based and service clients globally. Our mission is to help creators, entrepreneurs, and specialists grow with clarity, connection, and confidence. Through strategic growth support, curated matchmaking, and community-driven support, we simplify the business side of growth, empowering professionals and businesses to scale intentionally, build aligned partnerships, and thrive within Chicagoland and beyond.\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nWe are seeking driven, high-performing interns who are ready to gain real-world experience in a dynamic professional environment. We are offering three specialized internships: Social Media Engagement, Development & Communications, and Content Creation & Graphic Design. \\n\\n\\n\\n\\nTrack 1: Social Media Engagement Intern \\n\\n\\n\\n\\nRole Summary: The Social Media Engagement Intern is an executive-level support role focused on digital footprint, cross-platform engagement, and grassroots-level public relations and brand management. You will serve as the frontline of our online community, ensuring our brand presence is as polished and efficient as our backend operations while maintaining a community-oriented and active presence.\\u00a0\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nKey\",\"apply_link\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/marketing-inter-at-gorgeous-growth-group-4448558755?utm_campaign=google_jobs_apply&utm_source=google_jobs_apply&utm_medium=organic\"},{\"title\":\"Remote Lead BI Developer, Marketing Analytics\",\"company\":\"Launch Potato\",\"location\":\"Chicago, IL\",\"description\":\"Launch Potato is seeking a Lead BI Developer t