ility for growth, efficiency, and customer quality\\n\\nAnalyze channel and partner performance to identify trends, risks, and opportunities, and translate findings into clear business recommendations\\n\\nCollaborate cross functionally with Product, Risk, Data Scie\",\"apply_link\":\"https://www.jobilize.com/job/us-il-chicago-search-marketing-analyst-deinde-financial-hiring-now?utm_campaign=google_jobs_apply&utm_source=google_jobs_apply&utm_medium=organic\"},{\"title\":\"Sales Data Analyst\",\"company\":\"World's Finest Chocolate\",\"location\":\"Chicago, IL\",\"description\":\"REQUIRED: Nielsen/Circana (IRI) Experience\\n\\n\\n\\nPOSITION OVERVIEW\\n\\n\\nWorld's Finest Chocolate is seeking a Sales Data Analyst to support our North American retail sales organization. This high-visibility role partners with national account teams (Walmart, Target, Costco, Kroger, etc.) to transform raw sales, syndicated, and trade-spend data into actionable insights via dashboards, ad-hoc reporting, ROI models, and trade-promotion analysis, while driving cross-functional projects from ideation to execution. The ideal candidate is a self-starter with strong Excel/SQL skills, early experience in Tableau or Power BI, project management discipline (timelines, stakeholders, deliverables), and a passion for CPG retail metrics.\\n\\n\\n\\nKEY RESPONSIBILITIES\\n\\n\\n\\nDashboard Development & Maintenance (30%)\\n\\n\\n\\n Build and refresh weekly/monthly Tableau (or Power BI) dashboards tracking:\\n POS velocity, ACV distribution, % promo, share of shelf\\n Category growth vs. prior year / plan\\n Customer P&L summaries\\n Automate data pipelines using Alteryx, Python, or native connector tools.\\n Utilize SQL to query and aggregate customer transaction data from a PostgreSQL database, identifying trends that informed marketing strategies\\n\\n\\n\\nRetail & Syndicated Data Pulls & Analysis (25%)\\n\\n\\n\\n Extract and cleanse data from:\\n Retailer portals (Retail Link, Partners Online, VIP, etc.)\\n Syndicated sources (Circana/IRI, Nielsen, SPINS, 84.51\\u00b0/Kroger Precision)\\n Perform period-over-period, plan-vs-actual, and promo lift analy\",\"apply_link\":\"https://www.ziprecruiter.com/c/Worlds-Finest-Chocolate/Job/Sales-Data-Analyst/-in-Chicago,IL?jid=fdb80840a411d5e5&utm_campaign=google_jobs_apply&utm_source=google_jobs_apply&utm_medium=organic\"}],\"selected_job\":{\"title\":\"Search Marketing Analyst\",\"company\":\"Deinde Financial\",\"location\":\"Chicago, IL\",\"description\":\"Growth Marketing Analyst  \\nDeinde Financial (dba Integra Credit) is hiring a Growth Marketing Analyst to drive performance across new customer acquisition channels. This role sits at the center of marketing, analytics, and revenue generation, with responsibility spanning partner channels, direct marketing, and emerging acquisition strategies.\\n\\nAbout the Role\\nYou will own the performance, optimization, and scaling of acquisition efforts across channels including partnerships, and direct mail. This role is designed to develop into a full funnel growth owner over time, with increasing responsibility for channel strategy, testing, and unit economics.\\n\\nAs part of this role, you will leverage automation and agentic AI tools to improve speed, accuracy, and decision making. This includes working with platforms such as Amazon QuickSight and Amazon SageMaker, and continuously evolving how work is executed as automation capabilities expand.\\n\\nThis position reports directly to the Vice President of Marketing and offers direct exposure to executive decision making, forecasting, and growth strategy.\\n\\nJob Responsibilities\\n\\nOwn performance across new customer acquisition channels, including partnerships and direct marketing, with accountability for growth, efficiency, and customer quality\\n\\nAnalyze channel and partner performance to identify trends, risks, and opportunities, and translate findings into clear business recommendations\\n\\nCollaborate cross functionally with Product, Risk, Data Scie\",\"apply_link\":\"https://www.jobilize.com/job/us-il-chicago-search-marketing-analyst-deinde-financial-hiring-now?utm_campaign=google_jobs_apply&utm_source=google_jobs_apply&utm_medium=organic\"},\"reason_selected\":\"The role focuses on acquisition channel performance and optimization, directly matching Rahul\u2019s marketing analytics experience and skill set.\"}"
