ndations for the marketing team\\nSupported the marketing team in preparing monthly reports summarizing customer acquisition cost and lifetime value trends\\n\\nPROJECTS\\n\\nCustomer Churn Analysis for Subscription App\\nAnalyzed 6 months of user behavior data to identify the top 5 factors driving subscription cancellations, presenting findings to a mock stakeholder panel\\n\\nSocial Media Sentiment Tracker\\nBuilt a Python script using Tweepy and TextBlob to track sentiment around a sample brand's social mentions over a 30 day period\\n\\nSKILLS\\n\\nAnalytics Tools: Google Analytics, Google Data Studio, Meta Ads Manager, Google Ads\\nData and Reporting: SQL, Excel, Python (basic), Tableau\\nMarketing Platforms: HubSpot, Mailchimp, Hootsuite\\nOther: A/B Testing, Customer Segmentation, Campaign Reporting, Presentation Skills\\n\\nCERTIFICATIONS\\n\\nGoogle Analytics Individual Qualification, 2024\\nHubSpot Content Marketing Certification, 2024\"}"
